1:["$","main",null,{"className":"site article-page","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"article-frame","children":[["$","$La",null,{"className":"desktop-brand","href":"/","children":"Thinkinghaus"}],["$","article",null,{"className":"article-column","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Remain Stranger"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"August 6, 2026"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"2 minutes"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-body","children":[[["$","p","0-There is a scene in The Odyssey where Eumaeus picks up a puppy and throws it from a mountaintop.",{"children":"There is a scene in The Odyssey where Eumaeus picks up a puppy and throws it from a mountaintop."}],["$","p","1-He does it casually.",{"children":"He does it casually."}],["$","p","2-That is the disturbing part.",{"children":"That is the disturbing part."}],["$","p","3-Odysseus stops him from throwing another and chooses the puppy who will become Argos. The moment becomes understandable again. We know who to identify with and how to feel.",{"children":"Odysseus stops him from throwing another and chooses the puppy who will become Argos. The moment becomes understandable again. We know who to identify with and how to feel."}],["$","p","4-But briefly, the film opens onto a stranger world.",{"children":"But briefly, the film opens onto a stranger world."}],["$","p","5-It is a world in which people live closer to death. The borders between necessity, ritual, and cruelty are not where I expect them to be.",{"children":"It is a world in which people live closer to death. The borders between necessity, ritual, and cruelty are not where I expect them to be."}],["$","p","6-I wanted the film to remain there a little longer.",{"children":"I wanted the film to remain there a little longer."}],["$","p","7-When I encounter something unfamiliar, I tend to look for a contemporary equivalent. A god becomes a psychological condition. A monster becomes trauma. A voyage becomes a metaphor for recovering from war.",{"children":"When I encounter something unfamiliar, I tend to look for a contemporary equivalent. A god becomes a psychological condition. A monster becomes trauma. A voyage becomes a metaphor for recovering from war."}],["$","p","8-These translations give me a way into an old story. They can also close the door behind me.",{"children":"These translations give me a way into an old story. They can also close the door behind me."}],["$","p","9-Homer does not always allow that.",{"children":"Homer does not always allow that."}],["$","p","10-His gods are vain, generous, jealous, sexual, petty, and terrifying. They do not behave like symbols. They behave more like weather with personalities.",{"children":"His gods are vain, generous, jealous, sexual, petty, and terrifying. They do not behave like symbols. They behave more like weather with personalities."}],["$","p","11-Human beings live beneath these forces without expecting the universe to be fair or particularly interested in being understood.",{"children":"Human beings live beneath these forces without expecting the universe to be fair or particularly interested in being understood."}],["$","p","12-I am not sure I would want to live inside that world. I am also not sure I want it cleaned up for me.",{"children":"I am not sure I would want to live inside that world. I am also not sure I want it cleaned up for me."}],["$","p","13-There may be value in letting an old thing remain old. In allowing its assumptions to sit beside mine without forcing the two to agree.",{"children":"There may be value in letting an old thing remain old. In allowing its assumptions to sit beside mine without forcing the two to agree."}],"$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le","$Lf"],null]}],"$L10"]}]]}]}]
b:["$","p","14-The puppy scene carries a little of that feeling. The world does not stop to explain itself. For a moment, I am left without an interpretation.",{"children":"The puppy scene carries a little of that feeling. The world does not stop to explain itself. For a moment, I am left without an interpretation."}]
c:["$","p","15-I would like to remain there for another beat.",{"children":"I would like to remain there for another beat."}]
d:["$","p","16-Not because the past was wiser, or because strangeness is automatically profound.",{"children":"Not because the past was wiser, or because strangeness is automatically profound."}]
e:["$","p","17-I simply like the possibility of meeting an old story without immediately asking it to become me.",{"children":"I simply like the possibility of meeting an old story without immediately asking it to become me."}]
f:["$","p","18-To let its gods remain gods. To let the sea remain the sea.",{"children":"To let its gods remain gods. To let the sea remain the sea."}]
